---

## Quick rules

| Item | Rule |
|------|------|
| Naming | `crew_*` (officers) · `passenger_*` (passengers / ML roles) |
| API prefix | `/titanic/{character}` — registered in `adapter/inbound/api/__init__.py` |
| Schemas | Pydantic + `model_config.json_schema_extra.example` |
| Rose | Single `RoseModelInteractor` (ML + character) — `get_rose_model` provider |
| Smith chat | `POST /titanic/smith/chat` `{ message }` → `{ reply }` (Gemini via keymaker) |
| Wire-up | `jack.train_rose_model(rose)` in `SmithCaptainInteractor.__init__` |

---

## New characters / new apps

- New **character** within Titanic: copy router + interactor + provider triple; register in `__init__.py`.
- New **sibling app**: `backend/apps/{name}/` + `.docs/CLAUDE.md` — do not nest under `titanic/`.

